hasFlareGunUpgrade: While holding a Flare Gun upgrade
evilDownedorsmashedOrb: After smashing a shodow orb or crimson heart, or defeating Eater of Worlds or Brain of Cthulhu
deathActive: While Death Mode is active
defiledHM: While Defiled Mode is active and the world is in Hardmode
hasImpaler: While holding an Impaler
downedPolter: After Polterghast has been defeated
rogueActive: While wearing rogue armor
hasWings: While wearing wings
sellVanillaSummons: While the Town NPC Sell Vanilla Boss Summons configuration option is enabled
rippersEnabled: While the Rage and Adrenaline configuration option is enabled
downedEvil: After defeating Eater of Worlds or Brain of Cthulhu
downedCrabulon: After defeating Crabulon
downedHiveMind: After defeating Hive Mind
downedPerforator: After defeating Perforator
downedSlimeGod: After defeating Slime God
downedBrimstoneElemental: After defeating Brimstone Elemental
downedAstrageldon: After defeating Astrum Aureus
downedGuardians: After defeating the Profaned Guardians
downedScavenger: After defeating Ravager
downedPlaguebringer: After defeating the Plaguebringer Goliath
downedBumble: After defeating Dragonfolly
downedDS: After defeating Desert Scourge
downedEoCAcidRain: After defeating the first tier of the Acid Rain
downedAquaticScourge: After defeating Aquatic Scourge
downedBoomerDuke: After defeating the Old Duke
downedProvidence: After defeating Providence, the Profaned Goddess
downedDoG: After defeating the Devourer of Gods
dragonScalesAvailable: After defeating a buffed Mothron, and before buying Dragon Scales
downedCalamitas: After defeating Calamitas
hasIceBarrage: While holding an Ice Barrage
